1e:["$","section","method",{"id":"method","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"05"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Method & Worked Example"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"沿着输入、处理、输出走完 Pipeline。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"从历史 Agent 档案中选择个体，借助 foundation model 修改其代码，再用编程任务评估并保留有价值的变体。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Darwin Godel Machine: Open-Ended Evolution of Self-Improving Agents · v3","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"沿用论文真实的 Code Editing 场景：输入是一个父代 Agent 的源码、历史版本与编程任务日志。初始实现只能整文件编辑，修改者据此加入更精细的编辑工具。候选先通过基本运行与自我编辑检查，再在指定任务上执行，输出新版源码及成绩，进入 Archive。下一轮可以选用这个 Agent 修改另一个版本。这里被保存的是 Agent 工具实现；用户仓库中的补丁只是评估其能力的产物。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Darwin Godel Machine: Open-Ended Evolution of Self-Improving Agents · v3","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
1f:["$","section","mathematics",{"id":"mathematics","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"06"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Mathematical Foundations"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"从符号、直觉与简单例子理解理论。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"这篇论文没有给出开放式进步的收敛定理。先理解最简单的 Fitness：N 道题每题通过记 1，否则记 0，加总后除以 N 就是成功比例。这个值用于比较候选，但 Archive 还保留不领先的可运行版本。若测试集很小，两个分数之差可能来自采样噪声；若测试集被反复用于选择，最高分还会包含 Selection Bias。因此，Fitness 上升与真实泛化提高需要两组数据分别测量。"}],["$","pre",null,{"className":"math-block","aria-label":"数学表达式","children":"J(A) = (1/N) Σᵢ 𝟙[A solves task i]\nA: Agent implementation; N: evaluation tasks\n𝟙[condition] = 1 if true, otherwise 0"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Darwin Godel Machine: Open-Ended Evolution of Self-Improving Agents · v3","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
20:["$","section","experiments",{"id":"experiments","children":[[["$","span","results",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"results"}],["$","span","observation",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"observation"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"07"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Experiments & Claims"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"Research Question → Experiment → Answer"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Question：Archive 探索与自我修改是否真的有帮助？→ Experiment：与移除开放探索或自我改进的设置比较，并检查跨任务、跨 Model 的迁移。→ Answer：作者报告完整系统得到更强的候选，部分改进可迁移；这些对照支持两种机制在所测设置中的贡献。它们没有单独估计每一代 Improver 在完全相同起点下的后继质量。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Darwin Godel Machine: Open-Ended Evolution of Self-Improving Agents · v3","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"论文报告，冻结 foundation model 后，通过代码 self-modification，SWE-bench Verified 的 200 题子集成绩由 20% 提升至 50%；完整 Polyglot benchmark 由 14.2% 提升至 30.7%。原文还报告跨 benchmark、未参与 search 任务的迁移，结论仍限于所用 model、任务与 search 预算。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Darwin Godel Machine: Open-Ended Evolution of Self-Improving Agents · v3","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
21:["$","section","takeaways",{"id":"takeaways","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"08"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Takeaways"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"这篇论文改变了哪些判断？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"阅读 DGM 时应同时保存三条轨迹：当前最强 Solver、Archive 的组成、实际承担修改工作的父代。只看最佳分数曲线会隐藏绕路与失败，也无法解释后继从哪里来。代码中的 Recursive Reuse 有直接机制证据；长期改进速度是否提高，需要更强的因果对照。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Darwin Godel Machine: Open-Ended Evolution of Self-Improving Agents · v3","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
22:["$","section","assumptions",{"id":"assumptions","children":[[["$","span","limits",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"limits"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"09"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Most Fragile Assumption"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"哪一个假设失效会动摇方法？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"最脆弱的假设是：擅长解决 Coding Benchmark 的 Agent，也更擅长修改负责解决问题的机制。任务执行与改进策略可能需要不同能力。某个新工具提高 Solver 分数，却让后续修改更加复杂，就会让这两者脱钩。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Darwin Godel Machine: Open-Ended Evolution of Self-Improving Agents · v3","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"foundation model weights 冻结，开放探索中的档案维护与父代选择也固定；benchmark 得分提升是代码系统改进证据，不能直接推出全系统无约束 recursive evolution。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Darwin Godel Machine: Open-Ended Evolution of Self-Improving Agents · v3","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
23:["$","section","reproduction",{"id":"reproduction","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"10"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"One-Week Reproduction"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"用一周检验一个最小且明确的命题。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-hypothesis","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-hypothesis","children":"Hypothesis"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Day 1–2：建立 20 个开发任务和 20 个隐藏测试任务，固定 Model、Token Budget 与初始 Agent。Day 3–5：各运行三次短搜索，比较保留完整 Archive 与只保留当前最佳版本。Day 6–7：统一重测隐藏任务，记录候选数、总成本及有效祖先。只验证“保留中间版本是否帮助搜索”，不尝试复现整个大规模结果。"}],"$undefined",null]}]]]}]]}]
24:["$","section","counterexample",{"id":"counterexample","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"11"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Counterexample Design"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"如何构造有辨识力的反例？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-hypothesis","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-hypothesis","children":"Hypothesis"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"构造一组任务：加入专用字符串规则即可提高开发集得分，但这些规则会让 Agent 的源码更长、更难修改。将该高分 Agent 与较简洁的低分 Agent 放在相同新任务起点、相同改进预算下。如果高分父代产生的后继更差，就反驳了用 Solver Fitness 代理 Improveability 的充分性。"}],"$undefined",null]}]]]}]]}]
25:["$","section","follow-up",{"id":"follow-up","children":[[["$","span","outlook",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"outlook"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"12"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Follow-up Research"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"从缺陷与需求推导新的研究问题。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-prior","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-prior","children":"Prior Work"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"后续相关工作 HyperAgents 已研究可编辑 Meta-Agent，并用受控的 Improvement@k 比较产生更好后继的能力。因此，仅增加 Improver 评测不足以支撑新颖性。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","2603.19461v1",{"href":"#reference-2603.19461v1","aria-label":"来源 5: HyperAgents","children":["[",5,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-hypothesis","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-hypothesis","children":"Hypothesis"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"研究“改进组件的可迁移因果作用”：从演化源码中分离工具、记忆管理与修改策略，把每个模块交叉移植到不同父代，再测后继产生能力。目标是找到可跨 Agent 保留的 Improvement Primitive，而非继续扩大 Archive。STOP 与 SICA 展示整套 Improver 的复用，但模块移植后的因果贡献仍需独立识别；若模块只能在原始家族生效，提案的可组合性假设就失败。 相对 HyperAgents，待检验的缺口是改进机制在何种条件下可分解、移植与继承；需要同起点、同预算的组件交叉实验，识别机制作用及交互项。这个缺口尚未完成穷尽式检索，不能宣称已确认 Novelty。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","2408.08435",{"href":"#reference-2408.08435","aria-label":"来源 2: Automated Design of Agentic Systems","children":["[",2,"]"]}],["$","a","2310.02304",{"href":"#reference-2310.02304","aria-label":"来源 3: Self-Taught Optimizer (STOP): Recursively Self-Improving Code Generation","children":["[",3,"]"]}],["$","a","2504.15228",{"href":"#reference-2504.15228","aria-label":"来源 4: A Self-Improving Coding Agent","children":["[",4,"]"]}],["$","a","2603.19461v1",{"href":"#reference-2603.19461v1","aria-label":"来源 5: HyperAgents","children":["[",5,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
